ISO-10303-21;
/* Gp185: Unit-radius CYLINDRICAL_SURFACE; self-closed full-circle EDGE_CURVE (genuine single-revolution 3D CIRCLE) whose PCURVE 2D LINE spans u=[0, 40*pi] -- 20 full periods of the surface's natural 2*pi angular period, not a single-period offset (contrast Gs007/Gp023); degree-vs-radian confusion signature -- dozens of wraps -- for XSAlgo_AlgoContainer::CheckPCurve's multi-period span check */
